    <bpmn:process id="W_W4230" name="W4230. Project Bid, Tender &amp; Specification Pursuit" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Public/competitive tender (B2G links to VS-46, developer/contractor bid); spec opportunity
Frequency: Per bid
Volume: Major project bids/tenders (high-value, long-cycle)
Owner: Field Sales / Bid Manager / Key Accounts (VS-107)
Participants: Bid team, Key Accounts (VS-107), B2G (VS-46), Legal (VS-100.3), Surety/Bond (VS-116), Pricing (VS-16)
Source: workflow W4230 — Project Bid, Tender &amp; Specification Pursuit</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4230_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4230_Lane1" name="Field Sales">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4230_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4230_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4230_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4230_Lane2" name="Bid Team">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4230_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4230_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4230_Start4" name="Public/competitive tender (B2G links to VS-46, developer/contractor bid); spec opportunity">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4230_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4230_Task5" name="Field Sales/Bid decide bid/no-bid (strategic fit, winnability, capacity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Field Sales/Bid decide bid/no-bid (strategic fit, winnability, capacity, margin, ABC/competition links to VS-86.3/VS-129), and assemble the bid team
Responsible (R): Field Sales / Bid Mgr / Key Accounts
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management
Duration: Per bid</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4230_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4230_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4230_Task6" name="Bid team prepare the tender (technical proposal, pricing, surety/bond links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Bid team prepare the tender (technical proposal, pricing, surety/bond links to VS-116, compliance/legal VS-100.3, B2G requirements VS-46), and submit by deadline
Responsible (R): Bid Team / Pricing / Legal
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management
Duration: Per bid</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4230_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4230_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4230_Task7" name="Field Sales pursue specification (getting BuildRight products specified by…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Field Sales pursue specification (getting BuildRight products specified by architects/designers — links to VS-66 design services), manage the bid outcome, and transition wins to delivery (VS-11/VS-74)
Responsible (R): Field Sales / Key Accounts
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management
Duration: Per bid</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4230_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4230_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4230_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4230_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-651 (ensure controlled execution — Field Sales Daily Operations, Account Coverage &amp; Pipeline (PA-140.2).) | - CTL-651: bid/no-bid discipline; tender ABC/competition-compliant (VS-86.3/VS-129); bond secured (VS-116)
Owner: Field Sales / Bid Manager / Key Accounts (VS-107)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
