    <bpmn:process id="W_W4232" name="W4232. Compliance, ABC &amp; Data-Quality in the Field" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Field activity; compliance cycle; data-quality review
Frequency: Continuous + periodic
Volume: Field activity across the force (ABC, gifts, customer data, pricing)
Owner: Field Sales Ops / Compliance (VS-22) / ABC (VS-86.3)
Participants: Compliance (VS-22/VS-86.3), Legal (VS-100.3), Privacy (VS-91), Regional Mgrs
Source: workflow W4232 — Compliance, ABC &amp; Data-Quality in the Field</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4232_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4232_Lane1" name="Field Sales Rep">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4232_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4232_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4232_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4232_Lane2" name="Compliance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4232_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4232_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4232_Start4" name="Field activity; compliance cycle; data-quality review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4232_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4232_Task5" name="Field Sales/Compliance ensure ABC compliance in the field (gifts/hospitality to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Field Sales/Compliance ensure ABC compliance in the field (gifts/hospitality to buyers within policy, no kickbacks — esp. B2G/procurement buyers links to VS-86.3/VS-46), and log gifts/hospitality
Responsible (R): Field Sales Rep / Compliance
Accountable (A): Head of Field Sales
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4232_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4232_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4232_Task6" name="Field Sales/Privacy ensure customer-data quality and privacy (accurate CRM…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Field Sales/Privacy ensure customer-data quality and privacy (accurate CRM data, consent for marketing links to VS-91/VS-126), and pricing integrity (no off-tariff discounting links to VS-118)
Responsible (R): Field Sales Rep / Sales Ops / Privacy
Accountable (A): Head of Field Sales
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4232_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4232_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4232_Task7" name="Field Sales/Compliance audit field compliance (sample of activity, expense…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Field Sales/Compliance audit field compliance (sample of activity, expense, gifts), remediate, and report to governance (VS-86.3/VS-119)
Responsible (R): Compliance / Regional Mgrs
Accountable (A): Head of Field Sales
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4232_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4232_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4232_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4232_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-90 (ensure field-sales conduct &amp; pipeline integrity.) | - CTL-651: ABC policy + gift register (VS-86.3); customer-data privacy/consent (VS-91); pricing integrity (VS-118); periodic audit
Owner: Field Sales Ops / Compliance (VS-22) / ABC (VS-86.3)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
